  "details": "I have been on VRChat beta version on Quest standalone after the release of the new Main Menu 2.0, and I noticed that, in the Safety Settings, there is the option to toggle avatar audio on/off for all trust ranks, as seen in the screenshot below. \nI have known that, from the official VRChat documentation for Quest's Content Limitation, Quest avatars cannot have audio, so I would like this to be at least changed to permanently at Off state, like the permanent Off state for Shaders, or be removed entirely, so that it will not confuse all Quest players.",
